OL,3,A'Several victims' after bus crashes in
OL,4,AFrance, officials say
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bus has crashed in eastern France,
OL,7,Fofficials have said, with "several
OL,8,Fvictims".
OL,10,FThe incident happened on Friday morning
OL,11,Fin the town of Lent, north-east of
OL,12,FLyon, around 34 miles (55km) from the
OL,13,Fborder with Switzerland.
OL,15,FThe town's mayor Yves Cristin told
OL,16,FFrench media the bus "left the road and
OL,17,Fhit a tree in the ditch", while the Ain
OL,18,Fprefecture and education minister said
OL,19,Fthere were "several victims".
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
