OL,3,A'Several victims' after bus crashes in
OL,4,AFrance, officials say
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrench education minister Edouard
OL,7,FGeffray said the crash involved
OL,8,Fstudents, while transport minister
OL,9,FPhilippe Tabarot said he was on his way
OL,10,Fto the scene.
